Subject: [PATCH 099/258] test(pypto-x): add real-CANN Ascend hook and A2 live
 acceptance driver

Implements the PyPTO-X Ascend hook seam against the real CANN path for the
W8A-C acceptance: the explicit hook compiles an original PTO-ISA kernel with
Bisheng/CCE into a fatobj artifact, loads it with ctypes and executes it on a
910B3 through the ACL runtime.  The live driver covers environment injection
through PYPTO_X_ASCEND_HOOKS, compile/load/launch ordering and the adapter
format/ABI/target validation paths.  This is a minimal fixed-shape bridge, not
a Core IR -> PTO lowering.
